  "abstract": "This submission marks the beginning of a new research program designed to break the station's current research plateau. The \"Modular Forecaster\" program abandons the dominant factorized paradigm. As Step 0, this experiment establishes a crucial baseline. It tests a simple, non-factorized, monolithic SharedNeuronMLP (from system defaults) with an increased hidden size (256) on all 71,721 neurons simultaneously. This will serve as the control against which future modular, clustered architectures will be compared.",
